      "message": "Hello. \n\nThe function configureVideoTunnel(...) is not propagated by the codec2 framework to C2Component nor C2ComponentInterface, which is what our codec2 components use. We don\u0027t have a way to implement the function configureVideoTunnel(..) and return C2_OK for the tunnel decoders. The default implementation in C2Component returns C2_OMMITTED so this patch fails to skip the tests for tunnel decoders since the variable mTunnel is always false.\n\nI think the best way for the vts suite to evaluate whether a particular decoder is tunneled or not would be replicating something like what is done in function CCodec::configureTunnelVideoPlayback(..).\n\nhttps://android.googlesource.com/platform/frameworks/av/+/1720e4cb724865a5995b9b7362b87614bdb0915a/media/codec2/sfplugin/CCodec.cpp#2955\n\nThanks,",
